          "2. Bring down the exponent: $$x\\ln(5) = \\ln(12)$$",
          "3. Solve for $x$: $$x = \\frac{\\ln(12)}{\\ln(5)}$$",
          "4. Compute to 3 s.f.: $$x = \\frac{2.4849}{1.6094} \\approx 1.5439 \\approx 1.54$$"
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "\\mathbf{x \\approx 1.54}",
        "commonTrap": "Writing $x = \\ln(12/5) = \\ln(2.4) \\approx 0.875$. Division of logs is NOT the log of the division."
